0166e09699c", "chain": "ethereum"}, {"ts": "2026-10-29T22:43:47Z", "text": "WBTC swapper 0xB3dd \u2192 Uniswap: 97 WBTC ($7.7M)", "hash": "0x6c3c24672fec2a204222cbd01651d874874000e9780ea95519965ccc043fce6e", "chain": "ethereum"}, {"ts": "2026-10-29T22:43:47Z", "text": "0x68b346 \u2192 Uniswap: 3,210 ETH ($7.3M)", "hash": "0x6c3c24672fec2a204222cbd01651d874874000e9780ea95519965ccc043fce6e", "chain": "ethereum"}, {"ts": "2026-10-29T22:41:35Z", "text": "Main 0x5227 \u2192 WBTC swapper 0xB3dd: 167 WBTC ($13.2M)", "hash": "0x314928ff5fb72f708f77093c166dbb26a04709ac9c43ef19d2ed603d5543df66", "chain": "ethereum"}, {"ts": "2026-10-29T22:37:11Z", "text": "Main 0x5227 \u2192 RLUSD 0xE702: 127,953 AAVE ($15.9M)", "hash": "0x68fb0da5ace5d3c415e34f71084d46be4c7f4bf443d4391bc853ff785ad6bf43", "chain": "ethereum"}, {"ts": "2026-10-29T22:34:59Z", "text": "Main 0x5227 \u2192 0xCF4cA2: 2,568,257 LINK ($28.1M)", "hash": "0x317328369dfc29bf0c2236b2f7d8003f2b2f711c5174a919f2c7f0c139941b6f", "chain": "ethereum"}, {"ts": "2026-10-29T22:08:59Z", "text": "RLUSD 0xE702 \u2192 0x54401f: 20,492 ETH ($46.3M)", "hash": "0x5c7117134ed0965ef6126f9a60f257e7d553d2f1f57141935bad586bb4c2eeaa", "chain": "ethereum"}, {"ts": "2026-10-29T22:02:11Z", "text": "Main 0x5227 \u2192 wBETH/ENA 0x7f9D: 217,497,348 ENA ($40.5M)", "hash": "0x8bcbacb34b4e49b3e86675b3bc2a988461ded1207cc7e3a23bfd2577deb35aee", "chain": "ethereum"}], "notes": {"headline": "Binance hot wallets drained. Here is where it is going.", "context": ["Binance Hot Wallet 14 is EIP-7702 delegated to a contract the attacker deployed hours earlier. That is how a single transaction emptied it.", "Tether and Circle froze the main wallet's USDT and USDC within the hour (checked onchain). The attacker is racing to swap the rest into ETH and TRX, which cannot be frozen."], "timeline": [{"t": "28 Oct", "text": "Signer 0x7C86\u20265CA0 gets 0.3 ETH in three 0.1 ETH withdrawals from Tornado Cash."}, {"t": "~02:30", "text": "The signer deploys an earlier contract, 0x19bee294 (likely a test run)."}, {"t": "~16:00", "text": "The same signer deploys contract 0x63e842b0, about 4 hours before the drain. Binance Hot Wallet 14 is now EIP-7702 delegated to this contract (checked onchain), which is how one transaction could empty it."}, {"t": "20:20", "text": "Binance's BTC hot wallet sends 18,270 BTC ($1.44B) to bc1q0mtc\u20262mnm. It is split into 1,000 BTC chunks across about 19 new addresses, and none of it has moved since."}, {"t": "~20:20", "text": "970,537 SOL ($94M) goes from Binance to AffzFD\u2026BEaU on Solana."}, {"t": "20:16", "text": "First pulls from Binance wallets on Base and Optimism."}, {"t": "20:20", "text": "Binance's Tron hot wallet sends 612.7M USDT and 46.4M TRX to TG5i\u2026wzsGi."}, {"t": "20:24", "text": "The big one: one transaction, sent by the Tornado-funded signer, empties Binance Hot Wallet 14 into 0x5227\u20262f8c. That is 64 tokens, $2.54B."}, {"t": "20:24\u201320:41", "text": "More Binance hot wallets send $1.06B, including 780M USDC, plus funds on Arbitrum and Avalanche."}, {"t": "20:30", "text": "500M USDT split to 0x9749 and 200M USDT to 0x0Ddf. Address-poisoning spam starts within minutes."}, {"t": "20:34\u201320:49", "text": "325M USDT swapped to 122,316 ETH on Uniswap and 1inch."}, {"t": "20:38", "text": "195,460 ETH ($448M) parked in 0x8532\u202643D4."}, {"t": "20:46\u201321:16", "text": "Tron: 300M USDT to TPBk, 234M swapped to 639M TRX on SUN.io."}, {"t": "~21:10", "text": "Freezes: Tether freezes 971M USDT and Circle 823M USDC in 0x5227; Tether freezes 312.7M + 66M USDT on Tron."}, {"t": "21:02\u201321:12", "text": "A relay of fresh wallets (0x8d53, 0x77ED, 0x7Aa4) swaps $100M+ more USDT to ETH and sends $161M on to 0xCcBE."}, {"t": "~21:30", "text": "29,934 wBETH and 217.5M ENA ($116M) moved from the main wallet to 0x7f9D\u202615E3."}, {"t": "21:44", "text": "Hot Wallet 14 sends another 200.4M USDT to the main wallet. The wallet is still delegated to the attacker's contract, so new funds landing in it get swept. That USDT is frozen on arrival."}, {"t": "21:45\u201322:40", "text": "The attacker spreads ETH, PEPE, AAVE, UNI and AVAX across 10+ fresh wallets. All of 0x9749's ETH (122,310 ETH, $278M) moves to 0xc887."}, {"t": "22:41\u201322:45", "text": "$13.2M of WBTC moves from the main wallet to 0xB3dd and is swapped to ETH on Uniswap."}, {"t": "00:06", "text": "Tron: all 46.4M TRX ($16.4M) moves from TG5i to a new wallet, TRBd\u20262PRki. The frozen USDT stays behind."}, {"t": "00:08\u201300:34", "text": "The attacker starts selling altcoins from the main wallet. ZAMA ($5.9M), ZRO ($5.3M) and RSR ($4.7M) each go to a fresh wallet and are sold for ETH on Uniswap."}, {"t": "00:18", "text": "Arbitrum: 74.6M ARB and 8,426 ETH ($30M) move from 0x3E2b to 0x\u20260DA0."}, {"t": "22:16\u201323:27", "text": "First bridge cash-out: 0x554D swaps 200k AVAX for 1.56M USDC on Avalanche and burns it through Circle's CCTP bridge. It is minted at 23:27 to 0xc39e on Ethereum, and Circle has frozen that address (checked onchain)."}, {"t": "checked 00:55", "text": "Tether also froze the main wallet's 8.41M USDt on Avalanche and 6.2M USDT0 on Polygon (checked onchain)."}]}, "arkham_entity": {"usd": 5762414319.176941, "by_chain": {"arbitrum_one": 447.6478801034694, "avalanche": 25434851.588816755, "base": 2658062.0354988584, "bitcoin": 1408139126.4767275, "bsc": 1160.6728014142168, "ethereum": 3597637024.4051905, "flare": 0, "hypercore": 0, "hyperevm": 0.09027, "optimism": 4361683.97104055, "polygon": 10155361.876035988, "robinhood": 5.147733896331028, "solana": 92017401.97990885, "tron": 622009193.2850366}, "ts": "2026-10-30T02:33:41Z"}, "credits": {"arkham": 5375, "arkham_cap": 15000, "octav": 212}}